<title>UK: Rolls-Royce foreign ownership reaches maximum.</title>
<headline>Rolls-Royce foreign ownership reaches maximum.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Rolls-Royce said on Wednesday that the level of foreign ownership in the company had reached 29.5 percent.</p>
<p>This is the maximum level of foreign ownership permitted by the company's articles of association, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company's share price closed six pence higher at 245-1/2 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
